# DJ Skaylone (bouyonmusique.com, wave 7 parity, 2026-10-20)
# THIN DOSSIER: after full research, the verified public record is one official YouTube channel of downloadable bouyon riddims, one streaming single credit with Tiitii NBA, and one DJ mix tracklist trace. No biography, no interview, no press article and no streaming artist page under his own name were found. This profile states those limits openly and invents nothing.
# SPELLING NOTE: the site slug is dj-skylone, but every verified source spells the name with an A: DJ SKAYLONE. His own YouTube channel is titled DJ SKAYLONE Skay Beats, his video titles write DJ SKAYLONE, and Shazam credits WOOD (feat. DJ SKAYLONE). This profile uses the verified spelling DJ Skaylone in the text and explains the difference, instead of silently copying the shorter slug spelling.
# Sources used:
# - YouTube, official channel DJ SKAYLONE Skay Beats (opened 2026-10-20, youtube.com/channel/UCdKvMxXkfn8rhbmBuP8B6aw): channel description in French, DJ and beatmaker, all his compositions, some of them downloadable, enjoy the music. Video titles and counters as surfaced by YouTube search (consulted 2026-10-20): INSTRU BOUYON by Dj Skaylone, published time 10 years ago, 16K views; trumpet riddim by dj skaylone, 9 years ago, 12K views; RESPECTAR by DJ SKAYLONE, 9 years ago, 2.4K views; CHO TIME RIDDIM (BOUYON) by DJ SKAYLONE, 9 years ago, 3.8K views; Chris Riddim by Dj Skaylone (BOUYON) 2018, 8 years ago, 29K views; GUITARE RIDDIM by DJ SKAYLONE (BOUYON 2018), 7 years ago, 5.6K views; NOEL RIVE by DJ SKAYLONE (BOUYON 2019), 7 years ago, 8K views; CHRISMAS SKAY RIDDIM (by DJ SKAYLONE) NOEL 2020, download link in description, 6 years ago, 1.6K views. Several titles announce a download link in the description.
# - Shazam (search result consulted 2026-10-20): WOOD (feat. DJ SKAYLONE) [Bouyon 2025] by TiiTii NBA, release date November 22, 2024, label HEAVEN STUDIO, language French, BPM 160, composition and lyrics credit Terry Capitolin as songwriter.
# - Blaqrose Supreme podcast tracklists on moon.fm and ivy.fm (search results consulted 2026-10-20): track 37:15 listed as Tiitii NBA x Dj Skaylone, No Time Raw, inside a bouyon mix alongside DJ Skycee, DJ Luchshiy and DJ Taffy. Quoted here as a DJ tracklist trace only, with no platform release page found.
# - Disambiguation checks (2026-10-20): DJ Skycee, credited on Miimii Sé Miimii and appearing in the same mix tracklists, is a different DJ of the same scene. The TikTok account SkyLone at skylonemusic surfaced by search shows no established link with the bouyon beatmaker and no fact from it is used here. DJ Syclone and other near names in search results are unrelated noise.
